    "sensor_modules also includes the separately selected source composer and post-boot scripts.",
    "Presence checks do not prove HAL uniqueness, VINTF, ELF resolution, policy, functionality or all device-specific package coverage.",
    "Use only module-info and target-files collected from the same successful 23.2 build.",
    "The Pixelworks vendor provider variants must be exported to Make and installed into the package; compilation and declared shared_libs alone did not establish their presence in package-05.",
    "Legacy proprietary unversioned TinyXML2 consumers use the explicit v34 provider; presence alone does not establish XMLDocument layout or ELF dependency correctness. Check actual DT_NEEDED and provider identity separately.",
    "tail_modules is the complete 885-entry common vendor PRODUCT_PACKAGES list; the separately source-bound ferrari_vendor group checks all 421 device vendor entries. Cross-group duplicates are reported and checked once."
  ],
